WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Wait, you just said you would

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:14,900
Yes, you have to leave tomorrow, right?

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,580
Lost Qiyun?

4
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:20,690
Going to Qiyun should eventually go to Qingyuan Academy

5
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,690
This will be easy to handle

6
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:27,090
In three months, there will be a unified national admissions examination for higher education institutions.

7
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:30,210
I will go to Qingyuan Academy to find you then.

8
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:33,410
Really, you are confident that you will be admitted to Qingyuan University

9
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,260
Qingyuan Academy is among the top 30 in the Dragon Kingdom

10
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,100
Requires the top 100 in the province

11
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,580
No confidence

12
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:43,210
But if you do me a favor

13
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:44,970
Then it should be stable for a long time.

14
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:47,090
You said as long as I can do it

15
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:49,690
Lend me two million

16
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:51,730
After one year, I will pay you back with interest.

17
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,810
No problem, give me an account

18
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:58,330
I'll transfer it to you when I get back

19
00:00:58,330 --> 00:01:01,410
Wait, I have one last question.

20
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:05,630
Are we officially boyfriend and girlfriend now?

21
00:01:05,630 --> 00:01:17,850
I overlooked this issue

22
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:20,250
In our hometown, this is called stamping.

23
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,850
From now on you are mine

24
00:01:22,890 --> 00:01:24,220
How is it

25
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:26,220
Are you satisfied with my answer?

26
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:32,310
girlfriend

27
00:01:32,310 --> 00:01:33,590
This is the seal I stamped on you

28
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:42,180
You are mine too

29
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:45,130
I haven't decided how to deal with the title "Liberal Man" yet.

30
00:01:45,130 --> 00:01:47,370
I can't bear the title of a soft-boiled man again.
